# Exclude non-.NET directories from Docker build context
.git
.github
.research
research-cli
node_modules
Makefile
README.md
CLAUDE.md
.env
.env.example
*.md

# Exclude build output and NuGet assets (Windows paths break Linux Docker build)
**/obj/
**/bin/

# Exclude test projects from production images
src/Api.Tests/

# Exclude local SQLite databases
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Lokalni appsettings override fajlovi — ne idu u Docker image.
# Ove datoteke sadrže lokalne kredencijale (localhost DB, local Keycloak) koji
# bi u Docker kontejneru pregazili ispravne env varijable (Host=db umjesto localhost).
**/appsettings.Development.Local.json
src/BlazorApp/appsettings.Development.json
